DD-L006 (https://driverdesk.dev/errors/DD-L006)

  ⚠ integer division in an output with unit `Cel` drops the fraction
    ╭─[29-L006-integer-division.yaml:31:23]
 30 │     output:
 31 │       celsius: { cel: "raw / 100", unit: Cel }
    ·                       ─────┬─────
    ·                            ╰── integer arithmetic
 32 │     timeout_ms: 50
    ╰────
  help: CEL has no implicit conversion: write `double(raw) / 100.0` (spec §10.2)
DD-L016 (https://driverdesk.dev/errors/DD-L016)

  ⚠ safety block is not signed
    ╭─[29-L006-integer-division.yaml:41:1]
 40 │     timeout_ms: 50
 41 │ safety:
    · ───┬──
    ·    ╰── unsigned
 42 │   limits:
    ╰────
  help: fine for local development; the registry refuses to publish vendor descriptions with an
        unsigned safety block (spec §14.6)
